  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Campaign for Inclusion of Women and Young People in Political and Governance Processes (We-YOU Pro) - Action Aid Nigeria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project seeks to work with state institutions and civil society at the national and subnational levels to contribute to credible, peaceful and inclusive elections in Nigeria. This component aims to strengthen relationships between citizens, government and politicians in order to break the pernicious cycle of patronage based politics and elite control over power and resources and increase citizens&apos; confidence in Nigeria&apos;s democracy.</narrative>
  </description>
